	"data": "Three Locks When the Door Was Open\n\nThe Optiplex kept going offline because NetworkManager was entering ASLEEP state. I built a watchdog script (fixed the gateway from 10.0.0.1 to 192.168.1.1), then a sleep guard daemon that polls NM state every 30 seconds, then an NM inhibitor systemd service — three increasingly elaborate technical solutions. The actual fix? Two lines in a config file:\n\nI didn't push that until the third iteration, after the machine had gone down twice more.\n\nThis is the…",
